# git-clone-https-github.com-rashidabdullah5737-ai-CyberWolf-X

# 🐺 CYBERWOLF X

> Aggressive Recon Automation Framework for Ethical Hackers & Bug Bounty Hunters

---

## ⚡ Features

* Subdomain Enumeration
* Deep Reconnaissance
* Live Host Discovery
* URL Collection
* Port Scanning
* Technology Detection
* Content Discovery
* Vulnerability Scanning
* XSS Testing
* Automated Reporting
* Multi-Tool Integration

---

# 🚀 Quick Install (Kali Linux)

```bash
git clone https://github.com/rashidabdullah5737-ai/CyberWolf-X.git && \
cd CyberWolf-X && \
chmod +x install.sh cyberwolf.sh && \
./install.sh
```

---

# ▶ Usage

```bash
./cyberwolf.sh example.com
```

---

# 🧠 Integrated Tools

| Tool        | Purpose                  |
| ----------- | ------------------------ |
| subfinder   | Subdomain Enumeration    |
| assetfinder | Asset Discovery          |
| amass       | Deep Enumeration         |
| httpx       | Live Host Discovery      |
| gau         | URL Collection           |
| katana      | Web Crawling             |
| naabu       | Port Scanning            |
| nuclei      | Vulnerability Scanning   |
| dalfox      | XSS Scanning             |
| ffuf        | Content Discovery        |
| nmap        | Service Enumeration      |
| nikto       | Web Vulnerability Checks |
| whatweb     | Technology Detection     |

---

